===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[cross]]-[[examine]]|cross-examin|es}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[question]] (someone) [[closely]] in order to [[verify]] [[fact]]s, or [[information]] previously given.
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To question a [[trial]] [[witness]], who has already been questioned by the other side.

